          isTemplate = mkOption {
            type = (types.nullOr types.bool);
            default = null;
            description = ''
              Maps to the `IS_TEMPLATE` parameter of `CREATE DATABASE` and `ALTER
              DATABASE`. If true, this database is considered a template and can
